# Ruleset: Microsoft CDN
#
# Expects DIRECT.
#
# Update, download, Office delivery and certificate validation hosts. Must precede Platforms/Microsoft.list, whose suffixes would otherwise take them. update.code.visualstudio.com carries the VS Code update check.
#
# download.prss.microsoft.com is deliberately absent. Its mainland edges can cap each direct connection, so a completed request says nothing about download speed. The zone falls through to Platforms/Microsoft.list, where a proxy policy can avoid the direct path's cap.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cdn.office.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sfx.ms
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,windowsupdate.com
DOMAIN,az764295.vo.msecnd.net
DOMAIN,crl.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,oneocsp.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,ocsp.msocsp.com
DOMAIN,dl.delivery.mp.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,download.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,download.visualstudio.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,officecdn.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,officecdnmac.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,sdx.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,storeedge.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,tlu.dl.delivery.mp.microsoft.com
DOMAIN,update.code.visualstudio.com
